        {
          "id": "upload-and-resume",
          "title": "Resume an interrupted upload",
          "description": "A phone loses signal during a large upload. The session remembers which bytes arrived, so the phone only needs to send missing data. The app confirms the save once the chunks are durable and the file record points to them. This saves bandwidth at the cost of keeping upload state.",
